00:02:00.558 --> 00:02:04.432
So for comparison, here's a hundred million dollars composed of just 100s.

00:02:04.432 --> 00:02:08.712
This three foot tall stack here could fund an entire Hollywood blockbuster.

00:02:08.712 --> 00:02:10.848
